    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gifts for all players</h2>A national interactive card game where each player can have their own limited card and engage in multiplayer or singleplayer battles in classic TCG gameplay<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>More than 10 card elements</li><li>More than 100 card combos</li><li>More than 100 start cards</li><li>Get your limited card</li><li>No need to recharge</li><li>Update new cards every week</li><li>Adventure Mode</li><li>Design card for yourself</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join Us</h2>If you want to participate in card design, join the QQ group to contact the administrator or directly join our team<br>Tencent QQ Group\uff1a912748087<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Player Limited Card Example</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2746210/extras/9dc5425ac308db42f9dcb1ca791c0c55.avif?t=1704959058\" width=348 height=489 /></span>",
